Our proposed RAG stack
Layer	Technology
Document storage	Your existing FUTMxStore storage
Metadata and academic relationships	Django + PostgreSQL
Text extraction and chunking	PDF/text extraction pipeline
Embeddings	Hosted embedding model API
Vector retrieval	PostgreSQL + pgvector
